- (laughs) Keep shooting!

515
00:19:57,163 --> 00:19:58,965
You will overload
your power supply!

516
00:19:58,998 --> 00:20:01,268
- [Crow] We have to place
the lunch order, sir.

517
00:20:01,302 --> 00:20:02,202
- He's right!

518
00:20:02,235 --> 00:20:03,437
We'd better quit!

519
00:20:03,470 --> 00:20:04,605
We won't have enough
power to get back!

520
00:20:04,638 --> 00:20:07,007
- Right, we'd
better give up now!

521
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,875
- [Henchman] Shall I
prepare for takeoff, sir?

522
00:20:08,908 --> 00:20:10,810
- [Crow] Make it, ba-caw!

523
00:20:10,843 --> 00:20:13,113
(suspenseful music)

524
00:20:13,147 --> 00:20:14,080
- [Servo] Oh, I can
easily defeat them,

525
00:20:14,113 --> 00:20:15,848
I must get away, Bob!

526
00:20:17,883 --> 00:20:19,953
- Hey, Mickey, let's get
back with the others now.

527
00:20:19,987 --> 00:20:20,887
- Alright.
- And by the way,

528
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,088
you're so fine, hey Mickey.

529
00:20:22,122 --> 00:20:22,923
- They're taking off.

530
00:20:22,957 --> 00:20:24,190
Get them out of here!

531
00:20:24,223 --> 00:20:25,492
Get clear of the rocket blast!

532
00:20:25,525 --> 00:20:26,993
Everybody, get back!

533
00:20:27,027 --> 00:20:29,730
- [Servo] Back to your three
by five apartments, men!

534
00:20:29,763 --> 00:20:31,163
(loud zinging)

535
00:20:31,197 --> 00:20:34,000
A stand of seeders, a
spaceship is taking off,

536
00:20:34,033 --> 00:20:35,368
and I am tired.

537
00:20:35,402 --> 00:20:36,703
It's a haiku! (chuckles)

538
00:20:36,737 --> 00:20:37,537
- [Crow] (chuckles) That's nice!

539
00:20:37,570 --> 00:20:38,505
- [Servo] Oh, thank you!

540
00:20:38,538 --> 00:20:40,840
Into my modified piss helmet!

541
00:20:43,810 --> 00:20:46,613
- Get the emergency
reserve power working!

542
00:20:46,647 --> 00:20:47,847
I'm going to kill
this Prince of Space

543
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:49,850
if it's the last thing I do!

544
00:20:49,917 --> 00:20:52,352
- [Crow] There goes a norwalf!

545
00:20:53,753 --> 00:20:54,622
- [Mike] So what,
is he escorting them

546
00:20:54,655 --> 00:20:56,222
to the county line?

547
00:20:57,690 --> 00:20:58,558
- [Servo] Mom says I have
to wear this in space

548
00:20:58,592 --> 00:20:59,993
'cause it's cold.

549
00:21:01,862 --> 00:21:03,263
(loud zinging)

550
00:21:03,297 --> 00:21:04,632
- We're ready to shoot, sir.

551
00:21:04,665 --> 00:21:06,065
- Stand by to fire.

552
00:21:06,098 --> 00:21:09,870
- Let him get a little
closer, we can't miss.

553
00:21:14,373 --> 00:21:18,512
- [Crow] He's Prince of
Watching His Space Cushion!

554
00:21:19,713 --> 00:21:22,848
