and a good, close shave.

555
00:21:22,882 --> 00:21:24,785
- [Servo] I gotta turn
on the air, anybody mind?

556
00:21:24,818 --> 00:21:26,653
(loud dings)

557
00:21:26,687 --> 00:21:28,688
- [Crow] 20,000
leagues above the sea.

558
00:21:28,722 --> 00:21:32,025
(loud zinging)

559
00:21:32,058 --> 00:21:33,593
Wow.

560
00:21:33,627 --> 00:21:37,030
In exchange of deadly
negative scratches.

561
00:21:40,433 --> 00:21:41,468
- [Servo] Why don't
we take lunch now?

562
00:21:41,502 --> 00:21:43,437
- He's still coming on.

563
00:21:45,472 --> 00:21:46,407
- [Crow] It's a pretty good war,

564
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:48,842
but I'm gonna swing it around!

565
00:21:50,810 --> 00:21:51,745
- [Phantom] You there!

566
00:21:51,778 --> 00:21:53,113
Discharge the costing vapors!

567
00:21:53,147 --> 00:21:55,982
- [Mike] Yeah,
look who's talkin'.

568
00:21:57,050 --> 00:21:59,218
- [Servo] Engage
the musical saw!

569
00:21:59,252 --> 00:22:01,755
(eerie music)

570
00:22:03,557 --> 00:22:06,393
- [Crow] It's a
cloud of fish oil!

571
00:22:09,128 --> 00:22:10,963
- [Servo] Is that Ron?

572
00:22:12,365 --> 00:22:13,767
- [Mike] You know, if the
aliens got new spark plugs,

573
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:16,837
