574
00:22:16,870 --> 00:22:19,505
- [Crow] I see that their
ship totally let one!

575
00:22:19,538 --> 00:22:22,142
(loud zinging)

576
00:22:23,277 --> 00:22:24,543
- [Servo] Japanese
are frantically trying

577
00:22:24,577 --> 00:22:26,480
to pick up Singled Out!

578
00:22:28,415 --> 00:22:32,552
Humiliating game shows are
beamed across the nation!

579
00:22:34,020 --> 00:22:36,457
- [Man] Gentlemen, as you are
aware, our national territory

580
00:22:36,490 --> 00:22:38,058
was invaded by an
enemy last night.

581
00:22:38,092 --> 00:22:39,492
- Bingo here!
- He was able

582
00:22:39,525 --> 00:22:41,495
to paralyze our radar
stations and move at will

583
00:22:41,528 --> 00:22:43,330
through our national skies.

584
00:22:43,363 --> 00:22:45,098
It was eventually
driven out single-handed

585
00:22:45,132 --> 00:22:47,667
