unidentified flying saucer.

586
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:48,968
- [Servo] Bingo!

587
00:22:49,002 --> 00:22:50,903
- [Man] This pilot calls
himself Prince of Space.

588
00:22:50,937 --> 00:22:52,738
But as to who he is or
where he has come from

589
00:22:52,772 --> 00:22:55,575
or why he's fought our enemy,
we have no information.

590
00:22:55,608 --> 00:22:57,943
We do know, however,
that after the battle,

591
00:22:57,977 --> 00:23:00,747
the flying saucer was seen
returning to this area

592
