at dawn sometimes.

730
00:27:44,497 --> 00:27:47,433
(suspicious music)

731
00:27:55,175 --> 00:27:56,810
- I'm Hard Rock.
- I'm Coco.

732
00:27:56,843 --> 00:27:57,910
- I'm Joe.
- Hey, look!

733
00:27:57,943 --> 00:27:59,678
There's some funny people!

734
00:27:59,712 --> 00:28:01,247
They're crawling out of a hole!

735
00:28:01,280 --> 00:28:05,052
- Really, give me that!
- Abner, come look!

736
00:28:05,085 --> 00:28:05,985
